# mediadiff's determinism constraint makes line endings content rather than
# presentation: a golden file whose bytes depend on which OS checked it out
# is a false-positive generator, exactly the failure class this project
# calls P0. Pin every text file to LF on checkout, on every platform.

# Every file git classifies as text is normalised to LF in the index and
# checked out as LF on every platform, overriding the runner's
# core.autocrlf default. Both halves matter here: `text=auto` alone still
# lets a Windows checkout convert to CRLF, which looks like the fix and
# changes nothing.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Belt and braces. PROJECT.md forbids media binaries in git and
# scripts/gen_corpus.sh output is ignored, so these match nothing today;
# they exist so the first fixture someone does commit cannot be
# line-ending-converted by the `*` rule above.
*.mp4 binary
*.mkv binary
*.mov binary
*.webm binary
*.mp3 binary
*.aac binary
*.wav binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
